  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_020 (scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests whether switching to resnet50 image encoder and concat fusion (while keeping scvi_n200 RNA and transformer aggregation) affects performance. It isolates the impact of image encoder and fusion method, which are critical design choices with limited prior evidence. This balances exploitation (building on scvi_n200's success) and exploration (testing alternative image encoders/fusion strategies)."
}

